'''Gals of Summer''' (サマーガールズ, ''Samā Gāruzu'', '''Summer Girls''') was a limited Gacha that was available during the annually held event [[Summer Break Cats]]. In [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]], it was split into [[Gals of Summer Sunshine (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Sunshine]] and [[Gals of Summer Blue Ocean (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Blue Ocean]].

